Package: dsiapp
Title: DSI Studio - Data Suitability Index Screening Tool
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Javier", "Porobic", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "javier@example.com")
  )
Description: Interactive Shiny application for screening fisheries catch/effort data
    using the Data Suitability Index (DSI). Scores time windows for suitability in
    Fox/Schaefer surplus production models.
